1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:11,011
Speaking, task three. Story number 3: A bike accident. What happened to Mr Tichý yesterday? Tell the story from the pictures in the past tense.

2
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:13,652
What happened to Mr Tichý yesterday?

3
00:00:34,367 --> 00:00:36,753
Yesterday morning Mr Tichý was cycling to work.

4
00:00:36,967 --> 00:00:39,533
The weather was nice and he was riding quite fast.

5
00:00:39,733 --> 00:00:41,900
Suddenly a big dog ran onto the road.

6
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:44,633
Mr Tichý wanted to stop but fell off his bike.

7
00:00:44,833 --> 00:00:46,967
His arm hurt and he couldn't get up.

8
00:00:47,167 --> 00:00:49,167
People in the street called an ambulance.

9
00:00:49,367 --> 00:00:52,458
The ambulance came in ten minutes and took him to hospital.

10
00:00:52,667 --> 00:00:54,800
At the hospital a doctor examined him.

11
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:57,651
He told him his arm was broken and put it in a cast.

12
00:00:57,867 --> 00:01:00,158
Mr Tichý had to stay at home for six weeks.

13
00:01:00,367 --> 00:01:08,694
Tell story 3 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
